# Project instructions

## Axway policy authoring

Follow `.claude/apim-policy-dev.md`. Load skills from `{{SKILLS_HINT}}/` (`{{SKILL_NAMES}}`).

If MCP is available, attach `axway://apim/playbook/policy-development`. Policies live in apim-policies (`{{APIM_POLICIES_PATH}}`), not in the MCP server repo.
